' The hardware families: ADC, PWM, I2C. On a PicoCalc the I2C scan of
' bus 1 finds the keyboard controller at 31 (0x1F), and the PWM sweep
' plays on the speaker pin.
PRINT "chip temperature: "; ADC.TEMP(); " C"
PRINT "i2c bus 1 devices: "; I2C.SCAN(1)
FOR f = 400 TO 1200 STEP 100
    PWM.SET(26, f, 50)
    SLEEP 80
NEXT f
PWM.OFF(26)
PRINT "done"
